# Terraform and Kubernetes

Azure is the first cloud. Keep module names `vpc`, `k8s`, `postgres`, `object_storage`, `secrets` so AWS can match later.

A Kubernetes Job runs `knex migrate:latest` and must finish before the API deployment rolls out. Do not put secret values in manifests. Reference Key Vault or Kubernetes secrets by name.

```yaml
# BAD
env:
  - name: DATABASE_URL
    value: postgres://app:hunter2@db/app
# GOOD
env:
  - name: DATABASE_URL
    valueFrom:
      secretKeyRef:
        name: api-secrets
        key: DATABASE_URL
```
